{"data": {"event": {"id": "35847256-b159-4832-b67d-4e15bb0e203f", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Green Radiologie : mise en place de standards de qualit\u00e9 en 2026", "start": "2026-10-10T09:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T10:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Identifier les enjeux et les principaux leviers de la radiologie \u00e9coresponsable</strong>, en s\u2019appuyant sur les r\u00e9f\u00e9rentiels de pertinence et les recommandations de l\u2019ANAP.</li>", "\t<li><strong>\u00c9valuer l\u2019impact de la collaboration entre professionnels m\u00e9dicaux et biom\u00e9dicaux</strong> dans la mise en \u0153uvre de d\u00e9marches de r\u00e9duction de l\u2019empreinte environnementale en imagerie.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Conna\u00eetre les standards et outils d\u2019\u00e9valuation de la radiologie durable</strong>, notamment le label ESR Green, et identifier les actions permettant de les int\u00e9grer dans les pratiques quotidiennes.</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "9fcb28b3-5fb3-4d5d-ac63-87d53367941e", "name": "251", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "c92bc245-fb93-4b9d-9baa-62e5432d79a6", "title": "Fiches de Pertinence ANAP: R\u00e9f\u00e9rentiels de soins \u00e9coresponsables ANAP: pourquoi? Pour qui ?", "start": "2026-10-10T09:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T09:15+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "C92BC245-FB93-4B9D-9BAA-62E5432D79A6"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "61afcbb0-8a10-40a8-bdfe-08c8a649da14", "lastName": "Chouvel", "firstName": "Rudy", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Le Rheu"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "m